      "text": "Jehovah knows. The high priest who procured the overthrow of Queen Athaliah and the establishment of Joash as king; as a mark of honor he was buried with the kings of Judah (2 Kgs. 11:4–17; 12:2, 7, 9; 2 Chr. 23:1–18; 24:2–25).",
